                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "21.03 A full time employee who is reclassified to part time shall receive part time sick leave pro-rated for the balance of that sick leave year, based upon the employee's total length of service. Thereafter, the employee shall receive part time sick leave based upon the employee's total length of service.",
